OL,3,GNEWSAThree arrested after vehicles hit 
OL,4,Aby bricks                              
OL,6,FThree men have been arrested after     
OL,7,Feight vehicles were damaged by bricks  
OL,8,Fthrown from a bridge on to a busy road.
OL,10,FThe vehicles had their windscreens     
OL,11,Fsmashed between 02:00 and 02:30 GMT on 
OL,12,F31 October while driving under a       
OL,13,Ffootbridge near Bonnie Prince          
OL,14,FRoundabout on the A50, south of Derby. 
OL,16,FPolice said officers attended the scene
OL,17,Fand carried out a search of the area   
OL,18,Fand in nearby Henshall Drive. They     
OL,19,Flocated and arrested three men, who    
OL,20,Fhave since been bailed.                
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
