OL,3,GNEWSAThree arrested after vehicles hit 
OL,4,Aby bricks                              
OL,6,FOfficers have appealed to anyone in the
OL,7,Farea at the time, especially drivers   
OL,8,Fwith dashcam footage or homeowners with
OL,9,Fdoorbell video, to get in touch.       
